d50", "id": "iwan-rg/wikiann_translated_hu", "author": "iwan-rg", "disabled": false, "gated": false, "lastModified": "2024-08-27T15:42:06.000Z", "likes": 0, "private": false, "sha": "8c0f18a7430e28522583cbad2ff28c360f3c19cf", "downloads": 6, "tags": ["size_categories:10K<n<100K", "format:parquet", "modality:text", "library:datasets", "library:pandas", "library:mlcroissant", "library:polars", "region:us"], "createdAt": "2024-08-27T15:42:03.000Z", "key": ""}, {"_id": "69a2d643a50ce97141b7258a", "id": "metinovadilet/kyrgyz-bench-data-wikiann-ner", "author": "metinovadilet", "disabled": false, "gated": false, "lastModified": "2026-02-28T11:49:25.000Z", "likes": 0, "private": false, "sha": "c547003e843e7e631f2da258592c38dcfb961e48", "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tKyrgyz WikiANN NER Dataset\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tTask\n\t\n\nNamed Entity Recognition (Token Classification)\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDescription\n\t\n\nWikiANN NER dataset translated from English to Kyrgyz. Each entry contains English tokens with NER tags and a corresponding Kyrgyz translation. Entity names (proper nouns) are preserved as-is in the Kyrgyz text, so the NER tags align across both languages.\n\n3 entity types: PER, ORG, LOC\nFormat: JSONL with fields: tokens, ner_tags, sentence, sentence_ky\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/metinovadilet/kyrgyz-bench-data-wikiann-ner.", "downloads": 6, "tags": ["size_categories:10K<n<100K", "format:json", "modality:text", "library:datasets", "library:pandas", "library:polars", "library:mlcroissant", "region:us"], "createdAt": "2026-02-28T11:49:23.000Z", "key": ""}, {"_id": "6a105928c011f6142375b8e3", "id": "suchun/WikiANN", "author": "suchun", "disabled": false, "gated": "auto", "lastModified": "2026-05-22T13:40:25.000Z", "likes": 0, "private": false, "sha": "365604da0c1ef7ae33261227dd6c9338fc5fe977", "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWikiANN \u2014 Filtered Vector Search Benchmark\n\t\n\nA benchmark for vector search under conjunctive (AND) keyword filters,\nbuilt on top of Cohere's Wikipedia embeddings. Each base vector and each\nquery vector carries a set of integer keyword labels; a query asks for\nthe nearest neighbors among base vectors whose label set is a superset\nof the query's label set.\nTwo scales are provided:\n\n\t\n\t\t\nSubset\n# base vecs\n# base files\n# queries\ndim\ndtype\n\n\n\t\t\nwiki_35M/\n35,000,000\n70 shards \u00d7 500k\n5\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/suchun/WikiANN.", "downloads": 5, "tags": ["task_categories:feature-extraction", "license:mit", "size_categories:10M<n<100M", "modality:text", "region:us", "vector-search", "approximate-nearest-neighbor", "filtered-ann", "retrieval"], "createdAt": "2026-05-22T13:24:56.000Z", "key": ""}, {"_id": "686d1d8a43120cdeb0cedc0b", "id": "french-datasets/iwan-rg_wikiann_translated_fr", "author": "french-datasets", "disabled": false, "gated": false, "lastModified": "2025-07-08T13:41:21.000Z", "likes": 0, "private": false, "sha": "ee125c9acd5e07acec1721f3b5c5ef4a465fa305", "description": "Ce r\u00e9pertoire est vide, il a \u00e9t\u00e9 cr\u00e9\u00e9 pour am\u00e9liorer le r\u00e9f\u00e9rencement du jeu de donn\u00e9es iwan-rg/wikiann_translated_fr.\n", "downloads": 3, "tags": ["task_categories:token-classification", "language:fra", "region:us"], "createdAt": "2025-07-08T13:30:50.000Z", "key": ""}]